{"id":"878104c27c41b73e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Filtered Subset","display":"df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset — ZFC Order10 Filtered Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset — ZFC Order10 Filtered Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset — ZFC Order10 Filtered Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,P\\in V\">\\(D,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the partial-order predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10FilteredSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10FilteredSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10FilteredSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\emptyset\\neq D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(z\\leq_P x\\land z\\leq_P y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10FilteredSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\emptyset\\neq D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(z\\leq_P x\\land z\\leq_P y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is downward directedness in a poset, not a proper filter on a powerset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)$ is the partial-order predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10FilteredSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10FilteredSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\emptyset\\neq D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(z\\leq_P x\\land z\\leq_P y)","display":true}],"bytes":958,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2862","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset.md|58-df-zfc-order10-filtered-subset]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}